    "In many places everyone on a call must know it is being recorded. Tell the other party before you record." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En muchos lugares todos los participantes deben saber que la llamada se graba. Avisa a la otra persona antes de grabar."
